### Step 5 — CI-exact verification before push

```bash
# debt slice: zero goconst in the package
golangci-lint run --enable-only goconst ./pkg/voice/...
# CI gates (exact)
golangci-lint run --new-from-rev=HEAD ./pkg/voice/...
golangci-lint run --new-from-patch=diff.patch ./pkg/voice/...
# SA5011 clean on the diff
staticcheck -checks=SA5011 ./pkg/voice/...
# build / test / format
go build ./pkg/voice/...
go test ./pkg/voice/...
gofmt -l pkg/voice/     # must be empty
go vet ./pkg/voice/...
```

